    "details": "The Jackson project reports:\n\n> CVE-2026-91776: TypeDeserializerBase caches the resolved deserializer\n> under the raw, attacker supplied type id. With name based polymorphism\n> and a fallback, every unrecognized type id adds an entry and the cache\n> grows without bound.\n>\n> CVE-2026-91777: forward reference completion for JsonIdentityInfo\n> object ids scans the pending reference accumulator for every resolved\n> id, which is quadratic in the number of references.\n",
